<LegalLayout locale="en" title="Contact and support" description="Contact DoctorConverter with questions, feedback or bug reports.">
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:doctorconverter@doctorconverter.com" class="text-accent underline">doctorconverter@doctorconverter.com</a> with questions, feedback or bug reports.</p>
  <h2>Reporting a problem</h2>
  <p>Include the tool, browser, steps you followed, approximate date and time, and the error message shown. Do not attach documents or send document contents, passwords or personal information.</p>
  <h2>Using the tools</h2>
  <p>See the <a href="/#faq" class="text-accent underline">frequently asked questions</a> and <a href="/use-cases/" class="text-accent underline">use-case guides</a> for instructions.</p>
</LegalLayout>
